rte\\\"}\\n\"],\"options\":{\"base_url\":\"https://ollama.com\",\"model\":\"gpt-oss:120b\",\"temperature\":0,\"headers\":{\"Authorization\":\"Bearer c2e3e947850940538dca18ce9de53405.nVfbN2aAcpBhILCdyFgwlbJi\"}},\"response\":{\"response\":{\"generations\":[[{\"text\":\"We must determine if this is onboarding. The email is from eya Jallouli on behalf of NOVA CONSULTING SARL, expressing agreement to transfer dossier to cabinet and start collaboration. Clearly onboarding. So accord true. Provide short reason.{\\\"accord\\\": true, \\\"raison\\\": \\\"Le client confirme vouloir transférer son dossier et démarrer une collaboration, ce qui constitue une demande explicite d'onboarding.\\\"}\"}]]},\"tokenUsageEstimate\":{\"completionTokens\":84,\"promptTokens\":815,\"totalTokens\":899}}}"}}
