ocuments sont \\\"present\\\"\\n- documents_manquants doit être vide [] si complet est true\\n\\nIMPORTANT : Ne montre AUCUN raisonnement, AUCUNE explication, AUCUN texte avant ou après.\\nTa réponse doit commencer directement par { et se terminer par }.\\nToute réponse contenant du texte en dehors du JSON sera rejetée par le système.\"],\"options\":{\"base_url\":\"https://ollama.com\",\"model\":\"gpt-oss:120b\",\"temperature\":0,\"headers\":{\"Authorization\":\"Bearer c2e3e947850940538dca18ce9de53405.nVfbN2aAcpBhILCdyFgwlbJi\"}},\"response\":{\"response\":{\"generations\":[[{\"text\":\"The user gave a task: check completeness of documents based on OCR content. However, they didn't provide the OCR content or file names. They have placeholder sections:\\n\\nDOCUMENTS REÇUS (extraits OCR) :\\n\\nNOMS DE FICHIER REÇUS :\\n\\nBut no actual data. As assistant, we need to respond with JSON based on missing info. Since no documents are provided, we must assume none are present? The instructions: determine for each doc whether present among received documents based on OCR content. Since no OCR content is given, we cannot detect any. Likely all are missing. So output all missing.\\n\\nThus produce:\\n\\n{\\n  \\\"identite\\\": \\\"manquant\\\",\\n  \\\"kbis\\\": \\\"manquant\\\",\\n  \\\"statuts\\\": \\\"manquant\\\",\\n  \\\"be\\\": \\\"manquant\\\",\\n  \\\"rib\\\": \\\"manquant\\\",\\n  \\\"documents_manquants\\\": [\\\"Identité\\\", \\\"Kbis\\\", \\\"Statuts\\\", \\\"BE\\\", \\\"RIB\\\"],\\n  \\\"complet\\\": false\\n}\\n\\nNote: document names in French as in checklist. Ensure correct case: \\\"Identité\\\", \\\"Kbis\\\", \\\"Statuts\\\", \\\"BE\\\", \\\"RIB\\\". Provide JSON only.{\\n  \\\"identite\\\": \\\"manquant\\\",\\n  \\\"kbis\\\": \\\"manquant\\\",\\n  \\\"statuts\\\": \\\"manquant\\\",\\n  \\\"be\\\": \\\"manquant\\\",\\n  \\\"rib\\\": \\\"manquant\\\",\\n  \\\"documents_manquants\\\": [\\\"Identité\\\", \\\"Kbis\\\", \\\"Statuts\\\", \\\"BE\\\", \\\"RIB\\\"],